---
description: Keep comments succinct and limited to current behavior
alwaysApply: true
---

# Comments

Write a comment only when the code does not already state the fact. Keep it to one or two short sentences.

State the current constraint. Leave out a previous value, a finished migration, or a bug the current code no longer has.

```yaml
# Bad. The v0.3 mismatch is finished. A reader does not need it.
# Same commit as targetRevision in extraApps.yaml. The chart default tag
# is "latest", which accepted schema v0.5 while this file still said v0.3.

# Good
# Same commit as targetRevision in extraApps.yaml. Config schema is v0.5.
```
